{"source_passage_id": "HHS4867-L07-MANUAL-MUSCLE-TESTING-P0002-PASSAGE", "text": "Manual Muscle Testing (MMT)\n• Assessment of muscle strength\n• Manual muscle testing is a procedure for the evaluation of the function and strength of individual muscles and muscle groups based on the effective performance of a movement in relation to the forces of gravity and manual resistance.\n• Dynamometry is a method of strength testing using sophisticated strength measuring devices (e.g., hand-grip, hand- held, fixed, and isokinetic dynamometry).", "document_id": "HHS4867-L07-MANUAL-MUSCLE-TESTING", "document_title": "Lecture 7.1 - Manual Muscle Testing", "source_file": "21 - 7.1 Manual Muscle Testing 手動肌肉測試.pdf", "source_page_ids": ["HHS4867-L07-MANUAL-MUSCLE-TESTING-P0002"], "source_pages": [{"source_page_id": "HHS4867-L07-MANUAL-MUSCLE-TESTING-P0002", "document_id": "HHS4867-L07-MANUAL-MUSCLE-TESTING", "document_title": "Lecture 7.1 - Manual Muscle Testing", "source_file": "21 - 7.1 Manual Muscle Testing 手動肌肉測試.pdf", "page_number": 2, "page_number_type": "slide_number", "slide_number": 2, "pdf_page": 2, "formatted": "21 - 7.1 Manual Muscle Testing 手動肌肉測試.pdf, slide 2 (PDF p. 2)"}], "slide_number": 2, "section_ids": ["HHS4867-L07-MANUAL-MUSCLE-TESTING-P0002", "HHS4867-L07-MANUAL-MUSCLE-TESTING-PART00", "HHS4867-L07-MANUAL-MUSCLE-TESTING", "HHS4867-COURSE"], "section_path": ["HHS4867 - Functional Movement Science", "Lecture 7.1 - Manual Muscle Testing", "Manual muscle testing overview", "Manual Muscle Testing (MMT)"], "content_type": "slide_text", "ocr_text": null, "status": "generated_not_verified", "verification_status": "generated_not_verified"}
