{"source_passage_id": "HHS4867-L07-MANUAL-MUSCLE-TESTING-P0004-PASSAGE", "text": "subject completes ROM against gravity with maximal resistance\n4+\ncompletes ROM against gravity with moderate-maximal resistance\ncompletes ROM against gravity with moderate resistance\n4-\ncompletes ROM against gravity with minimal-moderate resistance\n3+\ncompletes ROM against gravity with only minimal resistance\ncompletes ROM against gravity without manual resistance\n3-\ndoes not complete the range of motion against gravity, but does complete more than half of the range\n2+\nis able to initiate movement against gravity\ncompletes range of motion with gravity eliminated\n2-\ndoes not complete ROM in a gravity eliminated position\nmuscle contraction can be palpated, but there is no joint movement\npatient demonstrates no palpable muscle contraction", "document_id": "HHS4867-L07-MANUAL-MUSCLE-TESTING", "document_title": "Lecture 7.1 - Manual Muscle Testing", "source_file": "21 - 7.1 Manual Muscle Testing 手動肌肉測試.pdf", "source_page_ids": ["HHS4867-L07-MANUAL-MUSCLE-TESTING-P0004"], "source_pages": [{"source_page_id": "HHS4867-L07-MANUAL-MUSCLE-TESTING-P0004", "document_id": "HHS4867-L07-MANUAL-MUSCLE-TESTING", "document_title": "Lecture 7.1 - Manual Muscle Testing", "source_file": "21 - 7.1 Manual Muscle Testing 手動肌肉測試.pdf", "page_number": 4, "page_number_type": "slide_number", "slide_number": 4, "pdf_page": 4, "formatted": "21 - 7.1 Manual Muscle Testing 手動肌肉測試.pdf, slide 4 (PDF p. 4)"}], "slide_number": 4, "section_ids": ["HHS4867-L07-MANUAL-MUSCLE-TESTING-P0004", "HHS4867-L07-MANUAL-MUSCLE-TESTING-PART01", "HHS4867-L07-MANUAL-MUSCLE-TESTING", "HHS4867-COURSE"], "section_path": ["HHS4867 - Functional Movement Science", "Lecture 7.1 - Manual Muscle Testing", "Oxford muscle-strength grading scale", "Muscle Strength Grading Scale (Oxford Scale) - grades"], "content_type": "slide_text", "ocr_text": null, "status": "generated_not_verified", "verification_status": "generated_not_verified"